<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  RUT_Karrathil.xml                      UtinniPatches - COMMISSION_LEDGER_CLEANUP_1

  Resolves the creature half of ledger slug
  `the_miasma:karr-fever-swarm-vector-pollinator-one-swarm`
  (design/Jawa/worldbuilding/biomes/the_miasma.md §4: "the disease vector
  and the mangals' only pollinator, one and the same swarm. You cannot have
  the trees without the fever"; miasma_fauna_roster_2026-09-23.md §3, row 5,
  RM_Karrathil: "a loose airborne cloud with no single body to fix on...
  thickest over flowering mangals at the heat of the day... the green-gold
  breath the biome is named for, seen close up").

  🔴 Working name only (roster's own naming register, not an owner ruling) —
  folded into MIASMA_SHIPPING_NAMES_1 (filed this pass, see RUT_Karrobel.xml
  header for the same posture). RUT_-tiered for the same reason as
  RUT_Karrobel (this pass, same file): RUT_Miasma.xml has not migrated to a
  standalone mod, so new content lands in the tier of the file it is wired
  into, not the roster doc's prospective RM_ naming.

  🔴 WHAT THIS PASS BUILDS vs. WHAT IT DEFERS, read the roster's own §3/§7
  cautions first: "must not become a mere pest" and "whether a Plant's
  reproduction can be gated on a nearby animal at all is an engine
  question, UNMEASURABLE on the Mac... check it on the Desktop before this
  row's mechanics are specified." This pass ships the CREATURE (a real
  PawnKindDef/ThingDef, flying, swarm-sized, wired into wildAnimals) and
  the VECTOR half needs no new mechanism at all — MIASMA_MECHANICS_1's own
  M4 spec is explicit that "the real diseases stay vanilla's, priced by
  diseaseMtbDays... no new disease system," and RUT_Miasma.xml already
  ships a <diseases> list (Malaria/SleepingSickness/Flu/Plague/etc., this
  same file). Karrathil is the biome's own fictional explanation for that
  already-working mechanism, not a new bite/contact transmission comp — no
  C# owed for the vector half.

  The POLLINATION half (gating a flowering plant's reproduction on
  Karrathil's presence) is genuinely new engine territory and explicitly
  gated on a Desktop check per the roster's own words above — filed as its
  own item, MIASMA_KARRATHIL_POLLINATION_GATE_1, rather than guessed at
  here. (Checked this session: mcp__rimsage tools DID connect and answer
  from this environment, unlike the Mac laptop this repo's other notes
  describe — but a source search for "pollinat"/Plant reproduction found no
  existing engine hook to gate on, confirming this is new territory, not a
  quick lookup; the Desktop check the roster asks for is still owed, not a
  laptop-only limitation this time.)

  Body/flight: cloned from vanilla Locust (BeetleLike, MEASURED via
  get_def_details this pass) — the exact worked precedent CLAUDE.md's own
  flight law names for a small flying insect: MaxFlightTime/FlightCooldown
  statBases, flightStartChanceOnJobStart/flightSpeedFactor/canFlyIntoMap
  race fields. No flying-animation frames yet (not blocking, per that same
  law) — flavor-only for now.

  "Loose airborne cloud with no single body to fix on" / "must work as a
  swarm, not a hero sprite": read as a HIGH wildGroupSize (12~30, INVENTED)
  on an otherwise ordinary small-insect PawnKindDef, same idiom this
  roster's own §7 uses for karravel/karrimeth's "carpet"/"mass" framing —
  no new C# needed for "reads as a haze in numbers."

  Combat: predator false, trivial tools, very low wildness/combatPower —
  the sheet frames this purely as atmosphere and mechanism carrier, never a
  threat in its own right (unlike a locust swarm's own vanilla manhunter
  framing, deliberately NOT copied here).

  ComfyTemperature 20/60: the_miasma.md's own measured median (42.8 C),
  same posture as RUT_Karrobel.xml this pass.

  Art: genuinely new, no existing render found (checked infrastructure/
  artpipe/{done,pending,registry.jsonl} for "karrathil"/"fever swarm"/
  "swarm haze" first — clean). One facing job filed this pass
  (rutkarrathil_v1_south) — the roster's own brief frames this as a haze
  effect over a single ground pose, not a multi-facing portrait; east/north
  deferred for the same reason RUT_Karrobel's were.
-->
<Defs>

  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase">
    <defName>RUT_Karrathil</defName>
    <label>karrathil</label>
    <description>Individually a fingernail-length, wet-winged thing, gold-dusted and easy to miss. Karrathil are never seen alone — only as a slow-drifting haze of them, thickest over flowering mangals at the heat of the day. That haze is the green-gold breath the Miasma is named for, seen up close: the same swarm that carries the biome's fevers from pawn to pawn is the only thing that carries pollen between its flowers. You cannot have the trees without the fever.</description>
    <statBases>
      <MoveSpeed>2.2</MoveSpeed>
      <Mass>0.02</Mass>
      <MarketValue>8</MarketValue>
      <Wildness>0.15</Wildness>
      <ComfyTemperatureMin>20</ComfyTemperatureMin>
      <ComfyTemperatureMax>60</ComfyTemperatureMax>
      <MaxFlightTime>10</MaxFlightTime>
      <FlightCooldown>5</FlightCooldown>
    </statBases>
    <uiIconScale>0.8</uiIconScale>
    <tools>
      <li>
        <label>mandibles</label>
        <capacities>
          <li>Bite</li>
        </capacities>
        <power>1</power>
        <cooldownTime>2</cooldownTime>
        <linkedBodyPartsGroup>Mouth</linkedBodyPartsGroup>
        <chanceFactor>0.2</chanceFactor>
      </li>
    </tools>
    <race>
      <body>BeetleLike</body>
      <predator>false</predator>
      <baseBodySize>0.05</baseBodySize>
      <baseHealthScale>0.2</baseHealthScale>
      <baseHungerRate>0.1</baseHungerRate>
      <foodType>OmnivoreAnimal, AnimalProduct</foodType>
      <fleshType>Insectoid</fleshType>
      <bloodDef>Filth_BloodInsect</bloodDef>
      <bloodSmearDef>Filth_BloodSmear</bloodSmearDef>
      <meatColor>(160,168,139)</meatColor>
      <meatMarketValue>0.1</meatMarketValue>
      <useMeatFrom>Megaspider</useMeatFrom>
      <herdAnimal>false</herdAnimal>
      <roamMtbDays>2</roamMtbDays>
      <trainability>None</trainability>
      <manhunterOnDamageChance>0</manhunterOnDamageChance>
      <manhunterOnTameFailChance>0</manhunterOnTameFailChance>
      <lifeExpectancy>2</lifeExpectancy>
      <gestationPeriodDays>2</gestationPeriodDays>
      <litterSizeCurve>
        <points>
          <li>(0.5, 0)</li>
          <li>(1, 1)</li>
          <li>(3, 1.8)</li>
          <li>(3.5, 0)</li>
        </points>
      </litterSizeCurve>
      <lifeStageAges>
        <li>
          <def>EusocialInsectLarva</def>
          <minAge>0</minAge>
        </li>
        <li>
          <def>EusocialInsectJuvenile</def>
          <minAge>0.02</minAge>
        </li>
        <li>
          <def>EusocialInsectAdult</def>
          <minAge>0.15</minAge>
        </li>
      </lifeStageAges>
      <flightStartChanceOnJobStart>0.3</flightStartChanceOnJobStart>
      <flightSpeedFactor>2.5</flightSpeedFactor>
      <canFlyIntoMap>true</canFlyIntoMap>
      <canLeaveMapFlying>true</canLeaveMapFlying>
      <soundMeleeHitPawn>Pawn_Melee_SmallScratch_HitPawn</soundMeleeHitPawn>
      <soundMeleeHitBuilding>Pawn_Melee_SmallScratch_HitBuilding</soundMeleeHitBuilding>
      <soundMeleeMiss>Pawn_Melee_SmallScratch_Miss</soundMeleeMiss>
      <soundEating>Insectoid_Eat</soundEating>
    </race>
    <tradeTags>
      <li>AnimalInsect</li>
    </tradeTags>
  </ThingDef>

  <PawnKindDef ParentName="AnimalKindBase">
    <defName>RUT_Karrathil</defName>
    <label>karrathil</label>
    <race>RUT_Karrathil</race>
    <combatPower>2</combatPower>
    <wildGroupSize>12~30</wildGroupSize>
    <ecoSystemWeight>0.15</ecoSystemWeight>
    <lifeStages>
      <li>
        <bodyGraphicData>
          <texPath>Things/Pawn/Animal/RUT_Karrathil/RUT_Karrathil</texPath>
          <graphicClass>Graphic_Multi</graphicClass>
          <drawSize>0.3</drawSize>
        </bodyGraphicData>
      </li>
      <li>
        <bodyGraphicData>
          <texPath>Things/Pawn/Animal/RUT_Karrathil/RUT_Karrathil</texPath>
          <graphicClass>Graphic_Multi</graphicClass>
          <drawSize>0.35</drawSize>
        </bodyGraphicData>
      </li>
      <li>
        <bodyGraphicData>
          <texPath>Things/Pawn/Animal/RUT_Karrathil/RUT_Karrathil</texPath>
          <graphicClass>Graphic_Multi</graphicClass>
          <drawSize>0.4</drawSize>
        </bodyGraphicData>
      </li>
    </lifeStages>
  </PawnKindDef>

</Defs>
